+//notes:
+//AID: 1~MAX for sta and 0 for bc/mc in ap/adhoc mode
+//MAC_ID = AID+1 for sta in ap/adhoc mode
+//MAC_ID = 1 for bc/mc for sta/ap/adhoc
+//MAC_ID = 0 for bssid for sta/ap/adhoc
